### Third-Party Components & Notices

This distribution bundles third-party binaries and interfaces; their full license texts are
in `deps/LICENSES/`. The MIT license above applies to this project's own code (UEVR plugin,
GUI installer, Lua interface, tooling). Key third-party components:

- **Praydog UEVR**: Copyright (c) 2023 praydog. Licensed under the MIT License.
  This project is an independent plugin and extension for UEVR.
- **OptiScaler / DLSS-NR Pre-SR fork**: Copyright (c) OptiScaler contributors
  and fork authors. Licensed under **GNU GPL-3.0-or-later**
  (`deps/LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt`).
- **MinHook**: Copyright (c) 2009-2017 Tsuda Kageyu. Licensed under the BSD 2-Clause License.
- **OpenVR SDK**: Copyright (c) Valve Corporation. Licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License.
- **NVIDIA CUDA runtime (`cudart64_12.dll`)**: Copyright (c) NVIDIA Corporation.
  Redistributed in binary form under the CUDA Toolkit EULA (Attachment A); see `deps/LICENSES/NVIDIA-CUDA-Redistribution-Notice.txt`.
- **Intel XeSS runtime**, **AMD FidelityFX** and **Microsoft DirectX 12 Agility SDK**:
  Part of the upstream OptiScaler package that the installer downloads at install time;
  NOT redistributed here. License texts are included for reference in `deps/LICENSES/`.
- **NVIDIA DLSS / NGX runtime (`nvngx_dlssnr.dll`)**: Copyright (c) NVIDIA Corporation.
  NOT included or redistributed; users must source it from official NVIDIA channels.
